# Claude Code advisory hook decision logs (issues #354, #357, #360).
# Already matched by *.log above; listed explicitly so a future gitignore
# reshuffle cannot accidentally start tracking them.
.claude/hooks/.gate.log
.claude/hooks/.crg.log
.claude/hooks/.crg-update.log
.claude/hooks/.crg-status.log

# code-review-graph knowledge graph (issue #360). The tool self-manages a
# nested .code-review-graph/.gitignore too; this root entry is belt-and-
# braces so a reshuffle of that nested file can't start tracking graph.db.
.code-review-graph/

# graphify macro architecture map + cache (issue #360). Regenerate with
# `graphify update .` -- never commit generated graph/report output.
graphify-out/
.graphify_cache/
GRAPH_REPORT.md
